{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球半導體標準組織JEDEC正在推進下一代DDR6內存標準的制定。隨着三星、SK海力士和美光等主要存儲廠商陸續啓動相關研發，DDR6距離實際商用又近了一步。新一代內存預計將大幅提升數據傳輸速度，並改變現有內存模塊的通道架構，以滿足人工智能、高性能計算和下一代伺服器平台不斷增長的帶寬需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586996.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T18:04:28.353243+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T17:47:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T17:57:35.810633+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T17:57:35.810633+00:00","content_hash":"9c107a10cb2b6a1649ee37a6ed732279b38016ce226f946737016b58595f82bb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}